	(text "opens the actuator supply" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 76.2 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify bottom)) (uuid "1d2fe235-e55f-51c8-87b0-35d01339daa4"))
	(text "XT30 lead to the controller board" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 78.74 85.344 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ef3d24cf-fd8a-50bd-8e58-4a4a5b2a801a"))
	(text "Actuator supply VBUS_ACT: pack + through the emergency stop SW1 to both actuators. It does not pass through the controller board." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 162.56 24.384 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d4ecdfbb-9a3a-5bf3-af33-6d2685b2024f"))
	(text "Actuator return to pack - (GND)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 162.56 16.764 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8244c1bb-6d5e-5d87-bc66-d442b186b3d0"))
	(text "GND" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 16.764 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bfb555e3-7fd7-52b4-957f-96e04e4e1a66"))
	(text "Controller board" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 125.73 49.022 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "77fe3727-156e-5df8-8465-3c04d2714e48"))
	(text "Parts and references as in the controller board file. Not drawn: board parts this system does not use (among them five 2-pin connectors), the capacitors, the SDIO pull-ups R10-R15 and the support resistors of U2 (R3-R8)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 125.73 54.102 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (italic yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "42e036c1-04ac-5825-ba03-26bbf6f69725"))
	(text "ON = pin 3 (BATTERY)\nOFF = pin 1 (GND)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 141.224 86.868 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "678f7c67-f113-552b-a75e-d4ce7f1ad3ba"))
	(text "U2 TPS54240 buck converter (with L1 and D1): VCC to +5V; its boot, enable, timing, compensation and feedback parts are not drawn.\nU3 NCV1117: +5V to +3.3V. Power switch: ON connects VCC to BATTERY, OFF connects VCC to GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 134.62 101.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "659fa62a-4076-599a-925c-8cd70c5929c5"))
	(text "+3.3V throw: PA8 high, assistance enabled" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 144.78 123.825 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a1a17a4e-b64c-5641-9d84-5dfb10e7fb18"))
	(text "+3.3V throw: PA10 high, logging on" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 144.78 169.545 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "49ff9cac-2e1e-5e23-823c-d19542506635"))
	(text "PA8 (CONTROL_MODE) high = assistance enabled; PA10 (DATA_LOG) high = logging on. The LEDs on PC9,\nPA9 and PA11 light while the pin is high (firmware)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 134.62 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2411743d-4e18-5f46-89b9-b181ee8d689b"))
	(text "SDIO: the firmware uses a 1-bit bus (CLK, CMD, DAT0); DAT1-DAT3 are wired on the board. R10-R15\n(10 kΩ pull-ups to +3.3V on CLK, CMD and DAT0-DAT3) are not drawn. Card detect PA12 has the\nR16 pull-up; the firmware treats low as card present." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 134.62 302.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "36680a18-00b3-52bc-bddd-b60fc22455d0"))
	(text "load capacitors\nnot drawn" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 377.19 231.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "260c617a-6084-524c-82b6-974c52cb3dd8"))
	(text "U1: only the pins this system uses are drawn, with their\nLQFP64 pin numbers. PB0, PB1 and PC11 (SD DAT1-DAT3) are wired\non the board but not set up by the firmware." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 284.48 287.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "39cb4977-87d6-5619-aee6-44493baf676c"))
	(text "CAN1: sensor bus (both sensor nodes). CAN2: motor bus (both actuators). 1 Mbit/s each; transceivers on +5V,\nS pin held low = normal mode." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 373.38 62.23 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b1ff9d47-e741-5235-ad2d-703881e6541d"))
	(text "Termination CAN1 (2 x 60 Ω): switch OFF in this system;\nthe board sits mid-bus and the bus ends carry 120 Ω." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 449.58 106.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ba7f3b48-27c1-5f76-aaa8-f5cb4559c569"))
	(text "Termination CAN2 (2 x 60 Ω): switch OFF in this system;\nthe board sits mid-bus and the bus ends carry 120 Ω." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 449.58 172.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "67116fb0-8c19-5598-9256-fa7b9508e434"))
	(text "HM-10 on USART1 (115200 baud 8N1). PB6 (UART_BLE_TX) reaches the module's RX through the\nR31/R32 divider. The BLE radio link to the host PC is not an electrical connection. PIO0 button and\nPIO1 LED are not used by the controller firmware." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 134.62 381 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f41b859a-e7be-585e-9f4b-139c376bd2f9"))
	(text "HM-10 set-up after assembly;\nno cable in operation" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 245.11 433.07 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right top)) (uuid "34c969cb-0390-5add-bd78-658ec3e774e1"))
	(text "1, 2 (USART2): not used" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 320.04 435.61 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right top)) (uuid "6a30a0a4-6d1d-5068-b1ea-4e569e2807ac"))
	(text "Left leg: leg cable, sensor node A201, actuator M2 (motor ID 1)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 539.75 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fa0a0680-6a1b-5ef9-b8b1-95c1d7861ef6"))
	(text "5, 6 not used" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 519.938 97.282 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "e9ce452d-60ba-5420-a07d-f477d001d982"))
	(text "5, 6 not used" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 537.21 96.012 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0c2e5ada-060c-5c8e-8b89-f001311ff144"))
	(text "node 3.3 V (from A201 pin 3V)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 619.76 62.992 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0ebff6c4-19ee-5ae4-9b30-a0d2b3abab82"))
	(text "PWR- is on GND: the same return to\npack - as M1." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 772.16 173.99 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1407b7b5-f85e-536f-a16b-a056b4adc57e"))
	(text "Right leg: leg cable, sensor node A101, actuator M1 (motor ID 0)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 539.75 208.28 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "311ec5df-a4f9-5093-a948-16a0d3a01e9a"))
	(text "5, 6 not used" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 519.938 252.222 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "18a8ddfc-a18c-5fde-a538-746acfa1abdd"))
	(text "5, 6 not used" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 537.21 250.952 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6255a8e2-940a-5821-a0db-da5384f9618a"))
	(text "node 3.3 V (from A101 pin 3V)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 619.76 217.932 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "261c3cee-6c36-5c05-b701-8dc78181f330"))
	(text "Actuator return to pack - (GND)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 787.4 16.764 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "81d48437-c0db-5fec-8d1c-ad67e2febf0f"))
	(text "Power" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 134.62 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5b86b707-d83f-5b2a-98f2-df3db6bd118e"))
	(text "One 6S LiPo pack (22.2 V nominal, 25.2 V full charge)\nfeeds two branches, the actuator bus and the logic\nbus. Its pack connector J1 is an XT60 (CON-1)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 140.9192 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b3058603-8df5-5a76-90ed-422038c2ffb0"))
	(text "Actuator branch: pack + -> emergency stop SW1 ->\nVBUS_ACT -> PWR+ of both actuators; PWR- returns to\npack -. The actuators' integrated driver accepts\n18-52 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 153.6954 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "08e362f5-0e76-5206-9946-daaffe42a748"))
	(text "The e-stop is in the actuator supply only: it is\nwired between the battery and the motors and removes\ntheir power when pressed. The controller board stays\npowered; with the actuators unpowered their\nCAN2 feedback stops, and after 100 ms the firmware\nlatches its stop (zero current) until reset." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 169.6974 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8e59c73f-83fb-57de-8b10-370080a01579"))
	(text "Logic branch: pack -> XT30 lead -> BATTERY-CON ->\npower switch -> VCC -> U2 (+5V) -> U3 (+3.3V)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 192.1764 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "57f17335-4c2b-5aa5-a681-f5378f973625"))
	(text "Low voltage: recharge the pack before it falls to\n19.2 V (3.2 V per cell; 3.0 V per cell reaches the\n18 V driver minimum). The actuator drivers also have\nbuilt-in undervoltage protection (error code 4 in\ntheir feedback)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 201.7014 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a1e84fa2-f653-5c69-aa56-dd9df5bc11be"))
	(text "Ground: one common ground (GND) for pack -, the\ncontroller board, the actuator returns and both\nsensor nodes (through the leg cables)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 220.9546 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4fcbfe7c-48b9-54d3-b6cb-9177fea2e5f0"))
	(text "Sensor nodes A101 (right) and A201 (left)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 553.72 336.55 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "66328926-ab58-5239-9eed-4ea5f280577a"))
	(text "Each node is an Adafruit Feather M4 CAN Express (ATSAME51, built-in CAN transceiver) that reads the MTi-3 over UART (Serial1) and the load cell through an\nINA333 bridge amplifier on A0 (12-bit ADC, 3.3 V reference), and sends the CAN1 frames the controller firmware decodes. The Feather plugs into the\nsensor-node carrier (Hardware/Electronics/Sensor-Node/), which holds the MTi-3, the amplifier and the CAN1 terminator drawn here and, not drawn, the\ndecoupling capacitors C1-C5 and the connectors J1 (leg cable), J2 (load cell) and J3 (two wires to the Feather's CAN terminals)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 553.72 342.8492 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "11979ad4-b079-5e8e-99a1-504d81afcf02"))
	(text "MTi-3 (Xsens MTi 1-series data sheet): VDD, VDDIO and nRST on the node 3.3 V; PSEL0, PSEL1 and CTS on GND select UART full duplex without flow control." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 553.72 358.8512 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "afb1ca08-9c1a-50b2-9206-eae1e0f75c0d"))
	(text "CAN1 frames (11-bit IDs, 1 Mbit/s): left leg 0x310-0x316, right leg 0x510-0x516. 0x_10: load-cell ADC count, int32 little-endian. 0x_11: roll, pitch; 0x_12:\nyaw; 0x_13: accX, accY; 0x_14: accZ; 0x_15: gyroX, gyroY; 0x_16: gyroZ; float32 big-endian. The controller stops assistance if 0x_10, 0x_11 or 0x_15 is\nmissing for more than 100 ms, if the count leaves 1-4094, or if it stays identical for 500 ms while assisting." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 553.72 365.1504 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9963bf3f-0b7a-547d-b269-51b0133fbb47"))
	(text "Amplifier: G = 1 + 100 kΩ / RG = 1 + 100 kΩ / 267 Ω = 375.53, the firmware gain; bridge excitation and ADC reference 3.3 V. The output reference is 2.09 V\n(16.2 kΩ / 28.0 kΩ divider, OPA333 buffer), so the torque limits -48 / +27 Nm fall at about 0.08 V and 3.22 V, inside ADC counts 1-4094. The load cell plugs\ninto J2 of its carrier (1 EXC+, 2 SIG-, 3 SIG+, 4 EXC-); if the reported torque does not have the sign of the applied torque, swap contacts 2 and 3 in its\nplug." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 553.72 377.9266 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "391cff42-4c57-5c00-a1cb-0df611e65bf0"))
	(text "Power: the node takes +5V on its USB pin from leg-cable pin 4 (leave its USB port unplugged in use) and makes 3.3 V on its 3V pin for the MTi-3, the\namplifier and the bridge." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 553.72 393.9286 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4f986f3c-c0f1-5ad4-9978-78d2796897e3"))
	(text "CAN termination" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 553.72 403.4536 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b84ede5d-b0ac-51ec-9ade-d888c38bae9b"))
	(text "120 Ω at each end of each bus: CAN1 at the two sensor nodes (R105, R205: R4 on the carriers; leave R4 out if the Feather's own terminator stays connected);\nCAN2 at the two actuators (R101, R201; fit them unless the actuator has a terminator built in). The controller board sits mid-bus on both buses, so its\ntermination switches CAN1 and CAN2 are OFF. Check with the power off: about 60 Ω between H and L of each bus." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 553.72 409.7528 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "22559f9a-0882-5f9c-bd6b-9b2533a748d5"))
	(text "Leg cables: LEFT and RIGHT carry the same buses; each cable serves its own leg: CAN2 (pins 3/2) to the actuator on that side (motor ID 0 right, ID 1 left),\nCAN1 (pins 8/7), +5V (pin 4) and GND (pin 1) to the sensor node, into J1 of its carrier: 1 GND, 2 CAN1_L, 3 CAN1_H, 4 +5V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 553.72 422.529 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "df2edd88-ee6a-59bc-99fc-b6b368b1e1df"))
	(text "How to read this sheet" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 464.82 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0e0eacf8-7a66-50aa-892f-c27cde426fb3"))
	(text "Lines are electrical connections; the same net label or power symbol is the same net. X: pin not connected. GND is one net." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 471.1192 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "440ef331-813c-5d7a-9919-4fb25c200d85"))
	(text "Connector symbols drawn across an outline (BATTERY-CON, LEFT, RIGHT, UPLOAD/DEBUG) and J1 show a mated pair: board or battery side and cable side, one contact per row." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 477.4184 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a9095192-db5c-5a98-98f1-386eabb0f896"))
	(text "Designators: controller-board parts as in the controller board file; off-board parts: BT1, J1, SW1, M1 (right actuator, motor ID 0), M2 (left actuator, motor ID 1),\n1xx right leg, 2xx left leg, A1 SWD probe. BOM: item in the bill of materials." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 483.7176 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "aa23c6e6-54a9-54e8-a273-a15e435e1f01"))
	(text "PWR_FLAG (small diamond): a KiCad marker that tells the electrical rules check that a supply drives the net; it is not a part." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 493.2426 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a4b9290d-c553-5f58-be1c-84d2acfb8116"))
	(text "Firmware" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 370.84 464.82 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b3a4daa7-da56-5e9c-a852-67e03d2e8ee1"))
	(text "Controller/ of the OpenHi-P-Exo repository. CAN1: sensor frames in; CAN2: motor commands\nout and feedback in; USART1: host link through the HM-10; SDIO: log files; USART2 and\nSWD on UPLOAD/DEBUG." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 370.84 471.1192 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "208d3a58-23f6-5011-8e1f-25c30d0fd1f6"))
